>   Yes, why not a lujvo instead, vlaxajmi, which seems natural (and as
> a plus, is already in noralujv)?

Different place structure. For example:

.i do'i klamburi zo cacra zo catra
.i do'i vlaxajmi mi lo nu la noltruni'u noroi vimcu naku lo stedu noda

Both refer to the same passage in Alice.

